00:03:53.260 --> 00:03:55.160
How do you spell fjallbo?

00:03:57.140 --> 00:03:58.780
It's Swedish.

00:03:58.780 --> 00:04:00.660
- More like bachelor vibe

00:04:00.660 --> 00:04:02.760
