credit card, but that's okay.

00:04:02.760 --> 00:04:04.522
We'll say rustic.
(Ross laughing)

00:04:04.522 --> 00:04:05.743
- Mm-hmm.

00:04:06.820 --> 00:04:08.820
- I don't know.
- Oh, god.

00:04:08.820 --> 00:04:10.240
- Oh, god,

00:04:10.240 --> 00:04:12.776
I didn't get the bout.

00:04:12.776 --> 00:04:13.900
- Okay, Drew, hold yours up.

00:04:13.900 --> 00:04:16.830
- Ooh.
- Fil-a-boug. Okay.

00:04:16.830 --> 00:04:19.420
