00:04:19.420 --> 00:04:21.520
(Drew laughing)
(audience laughing)

00:04:21.520 --> 00:04:23.410
Okay. Michelle, what is your spelling?

00:04:23.410 --> 00:04:24.700
- Okay, I got very nervous,

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:28.520
