00:04:28.520 --> 00:04:30.842
I don't know.
- Wow, you have umlauts!

00:04:30.842 --> 00:04:32.558
- Oh, yes.
- Oh, you know,

00:04:32.558 --> 00:04:33.860
those are those two little dots.

00:04:33.860 --> 00:04:37.423
I will say, there are
umlauts in the real spelling.

00:04:38.292 --> 00:04:42.370
Fjallbo is spelled F-J-A
- Oh!

00:04:43.450 --> 00:04:46.610
- umlauts, L-L-B-O,

00:04:46.610 --> 00:04:47.760
which means neither one of you

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:49.570
were close, really.
- No.

00:04:49.570 --> 00:04:51.630
- Wait, isn't there a J, you said?

00:04:51.630 --> 00:04:53.602
- There's a J.
- That's the J.

00:04:53.602 --> 00:04:54.435
- [Drew] Michelle gets this one.

00:04:54.435 --> 00:04:55.270
- You wanna give her a point?

00:04:55.270 --> 00:04:56.620
- Yeah. I should have gotten the chair,

00:04:56.620 --> 00:04:58.083
