- Aw, thank you!

00:04:58.083 --> 00:04:59.984
(audience cheering)

00:04:59.984 --> 00:05:02.906
You guys, we got another point!

00:05:02.906 --> 00:05:03.906
Get into it!

00:05:05.186 --> 00:05:06.760
- All right.
- That hurt so much.

00:05:06.760 --> 00:05:08.437
- All right.
- Okay, Drew, this is it.

00:05:08.437 --> 00:05:09.810
You're gonna win on this one.
- Go!

00:05:09.810 --> 00:05:10.930
- Okay, question number four.

00:05:10.930 --> 00:05:12.210
It's a picture scramble.

00:05:12.210 --> 00:05:13.490
Look behind you.
- Oh!

00:05:13.490 --> 00:05:15.930
