00:05:24.560 --> 00:05:26.544
Yes, Nate Berkus!

00:05:26.544 --> 00:05:28.981
- Love him!
- Did I get that one?

00:05:28.981 --> 00:05:30.104
- You get that one?
- Yes, you did!

00:05:30.104 --> 00:05:31.260
- You get that one.

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:33.355
- I'm playing for that side, right there!

00:05:33.355 --> 00:05:35.050
- So cool.
- Okay.

00:05:35.050 --> 00:05:37.320
(audience cheering)

00:05:37.320 --> 00:05:38.820
